{"group":"后端-Database","documents":{"/notes/后端/Database/Mybatis/00-Mybatis-Quick-Start":{"path":"/notes/后端/Database/Mybatis/00-Mybatis-Quick-Start","html":"<h1>00 Mybatis Quick Start</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Last Format Time：9/16/2026 19:24:55</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>持久层（DAO）的库，底层是JDBC</p>\n<p><img src=\"/pressidian/vault/1be073c-Pasted-image-20260914222422.png\" alt=\"Pasted image 20260914222422\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></p>\n<p>配置文件：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 这里报错可以换项目的编码格式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 配置数据库链接信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>spring.datasource.url=jdbc:mysql://localhost:3306/db01</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>spring.datasource.driver-class-name=com.mysql.cj.jdbc.Driver</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>spring.datasource.username=root</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>spring.datasource.password=123456</span></span></code></pre><pre data-lang=\"java\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">@</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">Mapper</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\"> // 在运行时会自动的创建代理对象（动态代理），会自动的将对象自动的存入IOC容器中</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">public</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> interface</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> UserMapper</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">    @</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">Select</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"select * from user2\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">    public</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> List&#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">User</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">> </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">findAll</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">}</span></span></code></pre><pre data-lang=\"java\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">@</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">SpringBootTest</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\"> // //SpringBoot单元测试的注解当前测试类中的测试方法运行时，会启动 springbook 项目 - IOC容器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">class</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> SpringbookWebQuickstartApplicationTests</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">    @</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">Autowired</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">    private</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> UserMapper</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> userMapper;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">    @</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">    public</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> void</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\"> testFindAll</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(){</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">        List</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">User</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">> </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">userList</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> =</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> userMapper.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">findAll</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">        userList.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">forEach</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(System.out</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">println);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">}</span></span></code></pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"辅助配置\" tabindex=\"-1\">辅助配置</h2>\n<p>配置对应的日志打印：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"bash\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">mybatis.configuration.log-impl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">=org.apache.ibatis.logging.stdout.StdOutImpl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">#==>  Preparing: select * from user2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">#==> Parameters:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">#&#x3C;==    Columns: id, username, name, age, gender</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">#&#x3C;==        Row: 1, 1, 1, 19, 男</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">#&#x3C;==        Row: 3, 2, 2, 19, 男</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">#&#x3C;==        Row: 96, 2026-09-14 00:09:45, shi, 19, 男</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">#&#x3C;==        Row: 98, 2026-09-14 00:09:20, shi, 19, 男</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">#&#x3C;==        Row: 190, r, shi, 19, 男</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">#&#x3C;==        Row: 196, 2026-09-14 00:10:28, shi, 19, 男</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">#&#x3C;==      Total: 6</span></span></code></pre>","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"辅助配置","text":"辅助配置"}],"highlighted":{}},"/notes/后端/Database/Redis/00-Redis-Quick-Start":{"path":"/notes/后端/Database/Redis/00-Redis-Quick-Start","html":"<h1>00 Redis Quick Start</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Last Format Time：10/6/2026 02:27:25</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1cr4y1671t\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1cr4y1671t</a></p>\n<p><em>目前只学到了实战篇，后面的再说吧</em></p>\n<p>Redis 是一种 NoSQL（非关系型数据库）</p>\n<p><img src=\"/pressidian/vault/a3a6ee8-Pasted-image-20260927221555.png\" alt=\"Pasted image 20260927221555\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"redis\" tabindex=\"-1\">Redis</h2>\n<p>Redis (Remote Dictionary Server)，特点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>键值型</li>\n<li>单线程（基于内存、IO多路复用）</li>\n<li>支持数据持久化</li>\n<li>支持集群</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>这玩意还得学Linux，绕了一圈又回来了</em></p>\n<p>后端/DevOps/Linux/00 Quick Start</p>\n<p>使用 Docker 来运行：\n<a href=\"#/notes/%E5%90%8E%E7%AB%AF/DevOps/Docker/Docker\">Docker</a></p>\n<pre data-lang=\"shell\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">docker</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> exec</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> -it</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> redis</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> redis-cli</span></span></code></pre><p>其数据库的数量是有限的 1-16 个：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"shell\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\"># 切换为 index 为 0 的数据库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">select</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> 0</span></span></code></pre>","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"redis","text":"Redis"}],"highlighted":{}},"/notes/后端/Database/MySQL/01-基础/00-MySQL-Quick-Start":{"path":"/notes/后端/Database/MySQL/01-基础/00-MySQL-Quick-Start","html":"<h1>00 MySQLQuick Start</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Last Format Time：10/7/2026 22:01:26</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Kr4y1i7ru\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Kr4y1i7ru</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"概念\" tabindex=\"-1\">概念</h2>\n<p>MySQL 是==关系型数据库管理系统（DBMS）==，用表组织结构化数据，使用 SQL 查询与修改数据</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>前端视角</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Server</td>\n<td>真正保存和处理数据的服务进程</td>\n<td>后端基础设施</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Client</td>\n<td>连接 Server 的工具，如 <code>mysql</code> 命令行</td>\n<td>类似调用服务的客户端</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Database/Schema</td>\n<td>一组表等对象的命名空间，在 MySQL 中两词可互用</td>\n<td>一个应用的数据集合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Table</td>\n<td>由列和行组成的数据表</td>\n<td>可类比结构固定的记录集合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Column</td>\n<td>字段及类型、约束</td>\n<td>类似对象属性，但有数据库级规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Row</td>\n<td>一条记录</td>\n<td>类似一个数据对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Primary Key</td>\n<td>唯一标识记录的非空键</td>\n<td>类似稳定的业务数据标识</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"连接数据库\" tabindex=\"-1\">连接数据库</h2>\n<p>连接需要主机名或 IP、端口、用户名、密码。MySQL 经典协议的默认端口是 3306；实际以服务配置为准。以下示例要求本地服务已启动，并已有可登录的 <code>root</code> 账户：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"powershell\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">mysql </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">-</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">h </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">127.0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> -</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">P </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">3306</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> -</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">u root </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">-</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">p</span></span></code></pre><ul>\n<li><code>-h</code>：主机；使用 <code>127.0.0.1</code> 明确连接本地 TCP。</li>\n<li><code>-P</code>：大写 P 表示端口。</li>\n<li><code>-u</code>：用户名。</li>\n<li><code>-p</code>：小写 p 后不填密码，按提示交互输入。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>原来的 <code>-p xxxx</code> 会把空格后的 <code>xxxx</code> 当作数据库名，而不是密码。虽然 <code>-p密码</code> 这种紧邻写法存在，但交互输入能避免密码直接进入命令记录。参见 <a href=\"https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/connecting.html\">MySQL 连接选项</a>。</p>\n<p>登录后出现 <code>mysql&gt;</code>，再输入 SQL。SQL 语句通常以分号结尾；退出客户端可输入 <code>exit</code></p>\n<pre data-lang=\"sql\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">SELECT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> VERSION</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">SELECT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> CURRENT_USER</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(), </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">DATABASE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">SHOW DATABASES;</span></span></code></pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"创建练习库和表\" tabindex=\"-1\">创建练习库和表</h2>\n<pre data-lang=\"sql\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">CREATE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> DATABASE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\"> backend_notes_demo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> CHARACTER</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> SET</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> utf8mb4;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">USE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> backend_notes_demo;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">CREATE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\"> users</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">    id </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> UNSIGNED </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> AUTO_INCREMENT,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">    name</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> VARCHAR</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">50</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">    email </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">100</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> UNIQUE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">    age </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">INT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> UNSIGNED </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">NULL</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">    created_at </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> CURRENT_TIMESTAMP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">) ENGINE </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> InnoDB;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">SHOW TABLES;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">DESC</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> users;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">SHOW </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">CREATE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> users;</span></span></code></pre><ul>\n<li><code>AUTO_INCREMENT</code>：未手工指定 ID 时生成自增值，不保证连续；不要用 ID 推断记录总数</li>\n<li><code>NOT NULL</code>：禁止空值，不代表字符串一定非空</li>\n<li><code>UNIQUE</code>：唯一约束；本例与 <code>NOT NULL</code> 配合保证 email 有值且唯一</li>\n<li><code>utf8mb4</code>：可表示完整 Unicode 字符范围，包括常见 emoji</li>\n<li><code>InnoDB</code>：本例使用的存储引擎，支持事务与外键</li>\n</ul>\n<p>字符串可用 <code>VARCHAR</code>，日期时间可用 <code>DATE</code> / <code>DATETIME</code>；金额等精确小数通常用 <code>DECIMAL</code>。字段类型应按业务范围设计，不要把所有数据都存成字符串。</p>\n<p>参考 <a href=\"https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/creating-tables.html\">建表入门</a> 与 <a href=\"https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/constraint-primary-key.html\">主键和唯一约束</a>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"增删改查-crud\" tabindex=\"-1\">增删改查 CRUD</h2>\n<h3 id=\"新增与查询\" tabindex=\"-1\">新增与查询</h3>\n<pre data-lang=\"sql\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> users (</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">name</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, email, age)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">VALUES</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> (</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">'Dano'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">'dano@example.com'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">22</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">       (</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">'Lin'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">'lin@example.com'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">20</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">       (</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">'Ming'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">'ming@example.com'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">NULL</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">SELECT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> id, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">name</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, email, age</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">FROM</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> users</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">SELECT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> id, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">FROM</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> users</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">WHERE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> age </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">>=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> 21</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">LIMIT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> OFFSET </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">SELECT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">*</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">AS</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> total </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">FROM</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> users;</span></span></code></pre><p>新库中依次应有 3 条记录，<code>age &gt;= 21</code> 只命中 Dano，<code>total</code> 为 3。没有 <code>ORDER BY</code> 时不能依赖返回顺序；分页采用稳定排序，排序字段不唯一时补上 ID 作为次级排序键。<code>LIMIT 10 OFFSET 0</code> 表示跳过 0 行、最多返回 10 行。参见 <a href=\"https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/select.html\">SELECT</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"修改与删除\" tabindex=\"-1\">修改与删除</h3>\n<p>先用相同条件查询，确认目标后再修改；这里暂时只修改练习数据：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"sql\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">SELECT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> id, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">name</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, age </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">FROM</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> users </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">WHERE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> email </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> 'dano@example.com'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> users </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">SET</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> age </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> 23</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> email </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> 'dano@example.com'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">SELECT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> id, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">name</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> FROM</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> users </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">WHERE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> email </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> 'ming@example.com'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">DELETE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> FROM</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> users </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">WHERE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> email </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> 'ming@example.com'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">SELECT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">*</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">AS</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> remaining </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">FROM</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> users;</span></span></code></pre><p>执行后 Dano 为 23 岁，剩余 2 条记录。<code>UPDATE</code> / <code>DELETE</code> 省略 <code>WHERE</code> 会作用于全部行；<code>DELETE</code> 删除数据行，<code>DROP TABLE</code> 删除表对象，<code>TRUNCATE TABLE</code> 清空表，三者不是等价操作。</p>\n<p>参见 <a href=\"https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/update.html\">UPDATE</a> 与 <a href=\"https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/delete.html\">DELETE</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"null-与聚合\" tabindex=\"-1\">NULL 与聚合</h3>\n<p><code>NULL</code> 表示缺失或未知，不等于 <code>0</code>、空字符串。应使用 <code>IS NULL</code> / <code>IS NOT NULL</code>，不能用 <code>= NULL</code> 判断</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"sql\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">SELECT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> id, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">name</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> FROM</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> users </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">WHERE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> age </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">IS</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> NULL</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">SELECT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">*</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">AS</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> rows_count, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">COUNT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(age) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">AS</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> known_age_count </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">FROM</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> users;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">SELECT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> age, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">COUNT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">*</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">AS</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> people</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">FROM</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> users</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> age</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">HAVING</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">*</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">>=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> age;</span></span></code></pre><p>若已经执行上面的删除，第一条查询为空，两种计数均为 2；若在删除 Ming 之前运行，<code>COUNT(*)</code> 为 3，<code>COUNT(age)</code> 为 2。<code>WHERE</code> 过滤原始行，<code>HAVING</code> 过滤分组结果。参见 <a href=\"https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/working-with-null.html\">Working with NULL</a>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"表关系与-join\" tabindex=\"-1\">表关系与 JOIN</h2>\n<p>一个用户可以有多条待办，这是一对多关系；把用户 ID 存在待办表中，避免每条待办重复保存用户全部信息</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"sql\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">CREATE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\"> todos</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">    id </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> UNSIGNED </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> AUTO_INCREMENT,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">    user_id </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> UNSIGNED </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">    title </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">100</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">    CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> fk_todos_user </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">FOREIGN KEY</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> (user_id) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">REFERENCES</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> users(id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">) ENGINE </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> InnoDB;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> todos (user_id, title)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">SELECT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> id, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">'Learn Spring Boot'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> FROM</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> users </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">WHERE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> email </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> 'dano@example.com'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">SELECT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> u</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">name</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">t</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">title</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">FROM</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> users </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">AS</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> u</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> todos </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">AS</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> t </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">ON</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> t</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">user_id</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> =</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> u</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> u</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">id</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">t</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">id</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">;</span></span></code></pre><p>预期 Dano 对应一条待办，Lin 的 <code>title</code> 为 <code>NULL</code>。<code>INNER JOIN</code> 只保留匹配行，<code>LEFT JOIN</code> 保留左表行，未匹配的右侧字段为 <code>NULL</code>。</p>\n<p>本例外键要求 <code>user_id</code> 指向存在的用户，引用列和被引用列使用相同类型与无符号属性。没有配置级联删除时，不能随意删除仍被待办引用的用户。数据库约束与应用层校验可以互补。参见 <a href=\"https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/example-foreign-keys.html\">Using Foreign Keys</a>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"事务\" tabindex=\"-1\">事务</h2>\n<p>一组操作一起成功或撤销</p>\n<p>在同一个连接中，使用 InnoDB 表执行：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"sql\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">START TRANSACTION</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> users </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">SET</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> age </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> 99</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> email </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> 'dano@example.com'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">SELECT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> age </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">FROM</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> users </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">WHERE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> email </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> 'dano@example.com'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">ROLLBACK</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">SELECT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> age </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">FROM</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> users </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">WHERE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> email </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> 'dano@example.com'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">;</span></span></code></pre><p>按前文顺序运行，事务内看到 99，回滚后看到 23。确认要保留改动时使用 <code>COMMIT</code>，它与这里的 <code>ROLLBACK</code> 是两种结束选择。</p>\n<p>默认自动提交模式下，事务外的单条修改通常自动提交。显式事务让多条 DML 成为一个工作单元；发生业务失败时，应用需要正确回滚，不能假设所有错误都会自动撤销整组操作。参见 <a href=\"https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/commit.html\">事务控制</a>。</p>\n<p><code>CREATE</code>、<code>ALTER</code>、<code>DROP</code>、<code>TRUNCATE</code> 等许多 DDL 会触发隐式提交，不能把它们和普通 DML 一样理解为执行 <code>ROLLBACK</code> 就能恢复。参见 <a href=\"https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/implicit-commit.html\">隐式提交</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"概念","text":"概念"},{"depth":2,"id":"连接数据库","text":"连接数据库"},{"depth":2,"id":"创建练习库和表","text":"创建练习库和表"},{"depth":2,"id":"增删改查-crud","text":"增删改查 CRUD"},{"depth":3,"id":"新增与查询","text":"新增与查询"},{"depth":3,"id":"修改与删除","text":"修改与删除"},{"depth":3,"id":"null-与聚合","text":"NULL 与聚合"},{"depth":2,"id":"表关系与-join","text":"表关系与 JOIN"},{"depth":2,"id":"事务","text":"事务"}],"highlighted":{}}}}